      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58db230764d6ff1cf2c451c7|full_name}: hyym, this request is about:\n> So it would be nice if we had some keyboard sockets in the animation override controller.\n\nSo it is not about gestures and emotes, but something completely different, like being able to map any key to any animation inside unity.",
